Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Apply mappings to bounded record groups, resolving semantic exceptions through evidence-backed decisions. Preserve identity and relationship provenance, isolate incompatible records, and avoid forcing all source variants into one target category for completion metrics.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
